LEGALIZE - North Macedonia: legislation as open data

PIPELINE SOFTWARE
The software that generates and maintains this repository is open source under
the MIT License:
https://github.com/legalize-dev/legalize-pipeline

LEGISLATIVE CONTENT
Documents are reproduced from the official LDBIS source:
https://ldbis.pravda.gov.mk/Prebaruvanje.aspx
The original source of each document is recorded in its YAML front matter.
Consult LDBIS for authoritative legal text and current status.

DISCLAIMER
This repository is an automated, unofficial mirror and is not legal advice.
